<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--MainWindow.ui: the build-all action family is omitted (no stubs);
solution lifecycle actions are present (NLang has a persistent .nsln);
the two output docks are direct tabOutput pages (not reparented
QDockWidgets); the 17 referenced icons are ported (nide.qrc).-->
